# Prototype / phase scope

- Foundation is in place; do not implement Jira, ADO, adaptive interviews, voice, or scoring until those phases
- Do not delete Figma source files (`frontend/.figma/`, screens, tokens)
- Do not rewrite Git history without explicitly reporting first
- Leave mocked frontend handlers in place until the matching implementation phase
- Prefer vertical API slices over speculative abstractions
